SUMMARY:Twisting Layers In Paris
DESCRIPTION:The workshop TwLIP will be an event open to an international audience devoted to discussion and exchange on the structural properties of twisted bilayers of 2D materials. This meeting will be held in Paris from the 14th to the 16th of October 2026 at Paris Cité University. This field of research has become a hot topic in the area of low-dimensional materials\, with a strong focus on the emerging an\nhttps://twlip.sciencesconf.org
LOCATION:Université Paris-Cité - Paris (France)
URL:https://twlip.sciencesconf.org
