DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261014
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261015
SUMMARY:Data-driven approaches in modelling cell and tissue dynamics
DESCRIPTION:Biological tissue dysfunction drives major diseases like cancer and age-related macular degeneration. Advanced data acquisition and mathematical modeling now provide unprecedented insights into these systems\, from cellular to tissue scales\, accelerating therapeutic development. In this framework\, data is essential for model calibration\, validation\, and mechanistic grounding making robust models ab\nhttps://datadrivenmodel.sciencesconf.org
